mos6 transient, 80 C, m=3, pulse 0..3 V on the gate through 10k, 2k load from 3 V
load "spice/mos6.osdi"
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vs vsource
model r sp_resistor
model nm sp_mos6 type=1 vto=0.7 kv=2 nv=0.8 kc=5e-5 nc=1.2 lambda0=0.02 lambda1=0.01 gamma=0.5 gamma1=0.1 sigma=0.01 phi=0.7 tox=20n cgso=3e-10 cgdo=3e-10 cgbo=2e-10 cj=5e-4 mj=0.5 cjsw=2e-10 mjsw=0.33 pb=0.8 js=1e-4 fc=0.5 rd=10 rs=10
vdd (dd 0) vs dc=3
rl (dd d) r r=2k
vin (in 0) vs type="pulse" val0=0 val1=3 delay=1n rise=1n fall=1n width=5n period=20n
rg (in g) r r=10k
vb (b 0) vs dc=-0.5
m1 (d g 0 b) nm w=10u l=2u ad=20p as=20p pd=24u ps=24u $mfactor=3
control
  options temp=80 tnom=27 reltol=1e-6 abstol=1e-15 rawfile="ascii"
  analysis tran1 tran step=2.5p stop=40n maxstep=5p
endc
